    "media:imagetext": "BEVERAGE LIST\nDINNER\nPLEASE BE OUR GUEST:\nBourbon\nWHISKIES\nScotch\nCanadian\nCOCKTAILS\nUnited Air Lines Special\nVery Dry Martini (Gin or Vodka)\nOld Fashioned\nManhattan\nDaiquiri\nBloody Mary\nGin\nSpanish Sherry\nVodka\nBeer\nTomato Juice\nSoft Beverages\n***\nHawaiian Macadamia Nuts\nLIQUEURS\nCreme De Menthe\nCognac\nDrambuie\nBenedictine and Brandy\nBlack Russian\nThis menu prepared in United Air Lines Flight Kitchen at John F. Kennedy International Airport,\nWilliam Dubacher, Chef.\nAPPETIZER\nCreamed Mushrooms en Croute\nSOUPS\nPuree Parmentier or Consomme Double au Sherry\nWafers\nENTREES\nGrilled Tenderloin of Beef, Colbert Sauce or\nRoast Squab Chicken, Colbert Sauce or\nGrilled Double French Lamb Chops, Mint Jelly or\nDungeness Crab Roll, Fines Herbes Sauce\nMainliner Baked Potato\nButtered Asparagus Spears\nROLLS\nHolland Rice, Whole Wheat or Knot Roll\nSALADS\nHeart of Lettuce Salad\nor Sliced Fruit, Avocado and Cottage Cheese Salad\nBleu Cheese Dressing\nor Thousand Island Dressing\nDESSERTS\nAssorted French Pastry, Petits Fours\nor Fruit and Cheese\nCoffee\nBEVERAGES\nSanka\nTea\nDinner Mint\nMilk\nSelected Domestic Wines and Champagne are served with this menu.",
